              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "keiram"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used ground elk which I browned before slow cooking it in the sauce. I thought it was great and tasted just like a sloppy joe. Another person who tasted it thought it was still a little gamey (but to be fair, they are sensitive to the taste in general).",
